                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Mr. Von Thile to Mr.
                        Bancroft.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1872-06-18"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi>
                            18, 1872.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The undersigned has the honor most respectfully to acknowledge the receipt from
                    Mr. Bancroft, Envoy Extraordinary and Minister Plenipotentiary of the United
                    States of America, of the obliging note of the 11th instant respecting the
                    boundary dispute between the United States and Great Britain, together with the
                    accompanying reply. The undersigned has not failed to lay before His Majesty the
                    Emperor and King this reply, as well as that delivered on the 10th of this month
                    by the Embassador of Great Britain at this Court.</p>
                <p>At the same time the undersigned, &amp;c.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>VON THILE.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
